# Trivy CVE baseline - accepted backlog as of 2026-09-05.
#
# PURPOSE: the CI vulnerability gate blocks NEW fixable HIGH/CRITICAL CVEs
# from being introduced, without failing every build on this pre-existing
# backlog. Entries here are NOT 'ignored forever': remove entries as their
# fixes land (weekly rebuilds pick up bookworm-security; Go CVEs need a
# cbox-init rebuild upstream; npm CVEs follow Node bumps).
# Regenerate/audit: scan the published images with
#   trivy image --severity CRITICAL,HIGH --ignore-unfixed <image>
# and prune entries that no longer appear.

